;
; Closes docs/fundamentals-audit.md:43, which harness marks 📖 = documented, NOT
; measured. Claim under test: 'counter reset -> first visible copy appears 5px right
; of the reset' (Towers, TIA Hardware Notes), stated for RESPx.
;
; One band per strobe cycle; consecutive bands strobe 1 CPU cycle = 3 colour clocks
; later. The grading test fits x = 3*c + k and reports k per object, so the phase is
; measured, and measured separately for the 8-clock player and the 1-clock missile
; and ball.
;
; 48 bands x 4 lines = 192 picture lines, 0 blank.
